---
title: Reporting a Vulnerability
---

{% aside type="danger" %}
Found a security issue? **Please don't post it publicly.** Instead, follow our [security policy](https://github.com/FOSSBilling/FOSSBilling/security/policy) to report it responsibly. This helps us fix the issue before it can be exploited.
{% /aside %}

## How to Report

1. **Don't open a public issue** — this could put users at risk
2. Review our [security policy](https://github.com/FOSSBilling/FOSSBilling/security/policy) for reporting guidelines
3. Follow the responsible disclosure process outlined there

We take security seriously and appreciate your help in keeping FOSSBilling safe for everyone.

## What Happens Next

- We'll investigate and confirm the issue
- We'll work on a fix
- We'll coordinate disclosure once a fix is available
- We'll credit you (if you'd like) when we publish the advisory

Thank you for helping make FOSSBilling more secure!
